<p>A wave of natural energies flow around you in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 5, 6.</acronym>  All creatures in the area will be affected by the Healing Nexus effect for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns.</p><p>On you, this effect causes each heal received to restore <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 9, 10</acronym> equilibrium and be <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">135%, 147%, 155%, 160%, 164%</acronym> effective.</p><p>On other creatures, all healing is intercepted and redirected to you at <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">35%, 47%, 55%, 60%, 64%</acronym> efficiency.</p><p>Only direct healing (not normal regeneration) is affected.</p>